    {
      "title": "The second public beta of \"Ball Heroes\" opens, and the 10v10 fierce battle!",
      "date": "2021-11-07 23:37:47",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4186653398783281894",
      "content": "1. Test details:\n\nThis test will last for two weeks from November 10 to November 25, when 500 player accounts will be opened!\n\n2. Major version update\n\n*Add 10v10 battle mode\n\n*Add accompanying robot\n\n*Improve the algorithm of general attack ball strength, which is determined according to the distance\n\n*Passing increases the cooldown\n\n*Fixed the problem that some characters did not move and some characters did not display the model when the game was restarted\n\n*Adjust scoring rules to increase goals and player kill scores\n\n*Novice guidance adjustment\n\n*Who is the MVP of the game has been added to the battle settlement page\n\n*Increase the camera vibration effect and decrease according to the distance\n\n*Add shortcut keys for player name hiding\n\n*In the login interface, you can set and change the password when creating a room\n\n*Add the function of placing the mouse in the middle of the screen when Right mouse button sliding\n\n*Fixed a bug where the robot had no damage effects\n\n*Fixed the bug that the player could not revive after the end of the cross game death action",
      "key": "1685980::c75bcc06419dc1d5a8b7aa6ffb06fff8af7ff1b7",
      "tags": null
    },
    {
      "title": "2021.12.08\u66f4\u65b0",
      "date": "2021-11-07 11:53:16",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4186653398781501040",
      "content": "\u8865\u4e01\u8bf4\u660e\uff1a\n* \u589e\u52a010V10\u5bf9\u6218\u6a21\u5f0f\n* \u6dfb\u52a0\u966a\u73a9\u673a\u5668\u4eba\n* \u8c03\u6574\u666e\u653b\u6839\u636e\u8ddd\u79bb\u6765\u786e\u5b9a\u51fb\u7403\u529b\u5ea6\n* \u4f20\u7403\u589e\u52a0\u4e86\u51b7\u5374\u65f6\u95f4\n* \u4fee\u6b63\u91cd\u65b0\u5f00\u59cb\u6bd4\u8d5b\u65f6\u6709\u89d2\u8272\u4e0d\u52a8\u3001\u6709\u89d2\u8272\u4e0d\u663e\u793a\u6a21\u578b\n* \u8c03\u6574\u5f97\u5206\u89c4\u5219\uff0c\u589e\u52a0\u8fdb\u7403\u548c\u73a9\u5bb6\u51fb\u6740\u5f97\u5206\n* \u65b0\u624b\u5f15\u5bfc\u8c03\u6574\n* \u6218\u6597\u7ed3\u7b97\u9875\u9762\u589e\u52a0\u4e86\u8c01\u662f\u6bd4\u8d5b MVP \u7684\u5185\u5bb9\n* \u589e\u52a0\u76f8\u673a\u9707\u52a8\u6548\u679c\u636e\u8ddd\u79bb\u9012\u51cf\n* \u589e\u52a0\u73a9\u5bb6\u540d\u5b57\u9690\u85cf\u7684\u5feb\u6377\u952e\n* \u767b\u5f55\u754c\u9762\u4e2d\uff0c\u521b\u5efa\u623f\u95f4\u53ef\u4ee5\u8bbe\u7f6e\u3001\u66f4\u6539\u5bc6\u7801\u7684\u529f\u80fd\n* \u589e\u52a0\u53f3\u952e\u6ed1\u52a8\u65f6\uff0c\u9f20\u6807\u653e\u5230\u5c4f\u5e55\u4e2d\u95f4\u7684\u529f\u80fd\n* \u4fee\u6b63\u673a\u5668\u4eba\u6ca1\u6709\u4f24\u5bb3\u7279\u6548\u7684bug\n* \u4fee\u6b63\u8de8\u7403\u5c40\u6b7b\u4ea1\u52a8\u4f5c\u7ed3\u675f\uff0c\u5bfc\u81f4\u73a9\u5bb6\u4e0d\u80fd\u590d\u6d3b\u7684bug",
      "key": "1685980::96ed9bd238a9e073adaf1027b2dcddfdc442182c",
      "tags": null
    },
